    <string name="about_mission_desc">ユーザーのプライバシーを損なうことなく、シンプルで信頼性が高く安全な通話機能を提供します。</string>
    <string name="about_app_desc">Nova Dialer is a privacy-focused communication tool designed to put you in control of your data. Core dialer data is stored on your device; it leaves only when you call, text, export or share.</string>
    <string name="privacy_policy_title">プライバシーポリシー</string>
    <string name="privacy_intro">Nova Dialerではプライバシーを最優先しています。</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_1_desc">Nova Dialer does not upload your contacts, call history, or any other app data to a server. The app has no INTERNET permission.</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_2_desc">Contacts, call history, and notifications are used only for the features you use. For quick replies Nova Dialer hands a pre-filled message to your own messaging app; it does not send SMS by itself.</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_3_desc">Nova Dialer does not sell or share data with third parties. Data leaves the device only when you call, text, export or share. An exported backup is protected only by the password you set.</string>
    <string name="settings_support_desc" formatted="false">Nova Dialerは100%無料、オープンソース、広告なし、プライバシー重視です。コードや翻訳の貢献を歓迎します。</string>
